OL,5,MLITHUANIA SHOWS NO SIGN OF CAPITULATION
OL,7, 103FSanctions deadline runs out Sunday
OL,8, 104FHurd "dismayed" by Soviet threat
OL,10, 110 MANDELAFcriticises sanctions easing
OL,12, 111 STRANGEWAYSFNegotiations resumed
OL,14, 105 EDUCATIONF"Crisis point approaches"
OL,16, 107 "GUN"FLabour calls for statement
OL,18, 115 KASHMIRFPakistan puts army on alert
