OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGLITHUANIA SHOWS NO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGSIGN OF BACKING DOWN
OL,5, Lithuania shows no sign of capitulating
OL,6, to Moscow's threat of sanctions unless
OL,7, it rescinds laws passed since the
OL,8, republic's declaration of independence.
OL,10,FIt has been given until Sunday to
OL,11,Frepeal the laws.
OL,13,FBut Lithuanian president Vytautus
OL,14,FLandsbergis has said he will not call
OL,15,Fan emergency meeting of parliament to
OL,16,Fdiscuss the threat.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, Soviet authorities say they
OL,19,Fhave found quantities of ammunition on
OL,20,Fa Lithuanian ship. The republic says
OL,21,Fthis is simply a propaganda stunt.
OL,23,D]FFromG14-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
