OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGEDUCATION APPROACHING
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pG"CRISIS POINT"
OL,4,D
OL,5, The president of the National Union of
OL,6, Teachers says education in Britain is
OL,7, "fast approaching crisis point".
OL,9,FBarbara Lloyd warned that if present
OL,10,Ftrends continued there would be a
OL,11,Fcomplete breakdown of the system
OL,12,Fwithin five years.
OL,14,FSpeaking at the union's annual
OL,15,Fconference in Bournemouth, Mrs Lloyd
OL,16,Falso warned of a brain drain of
OL,17,Fteachers to the Continent.
OL,19,FIn 1992, she said, the movement of
OL,20,Fteachers would be away from Britain
OL,21,Fbecause of better pay and conditions.
OL,23,D]FFromG14-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
